OL,3,GNEWSA'Success still seems unreal' says
OL,4,AGruffalo artist
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe illustrator who created The
OL,7,FGruffalo and helped spawn a global
OL,8,Fliterary phenomenon has said the
OL,9,Fseries' popularity still "doesn't seems
OL,10,Freal".
OL,12,FAxel Scheffler, who drew the pictures
OL,13,Ffor the best-selling books, first
OL,14,Fcollaborated with their author Julia
OL,15,FDonaldson, from Steyning in West
OL,16,FSussex, in the early '90s.
OL,23,APub: 21-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,330,320,200,140,0,100
