OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-$-%%%-!-%%%" ,%-$ -$%%-% ,,
OL,3,GNEWSA'Success still seems unreal' says
OL,4,AGruffalo artist
OL,5,
OL,6,FThis weekend he will be appearing at
OL,7,Fthe annual Hastings Storytelling
OL,8,FFestival, of which he is patron, where
OL,9,Fhe'll be reading, sketching and signing
OL,10,Fcopies of some of his best known
OL,11,Ftitles.
OL,13,F"To have had such huge success,
OL,14,Fespecially worldwide, just seems
OL,15,Fcompletely unbelievable to me," he
OL,16,Fsaid.
